SRR14119296	PRJNA718858	SRP312915	SAMN18577263	SRX10489636	Homo sapiens	H8826MLN	H8826MLN	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM5221374: H8826MLN Homo sapiens RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	Tumor tissue was lysed in TRIzol reagent with RNA isolated following manufacturers instructions. RNA-seq libraries were prepared using theNEBNext Ultra RNA Library Prep Kit for Illumina (catalog E7530L). Briefly, 500 ng total RNA was used to isolate mRNA with the NEB Next Oligo dT Magnetic Isolation Module (catalog E7490L). The isolated mRNA undergoes fragmentation, priming, cDNA synthesis and end repair/dA-tail. Individual index primers for multiplexing were added during PCR library enrichment after adaptor ligation.	15575063	778753150	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR141/096/SRR14119296/SRR14119296.fastq.gz	486d27457a36ba3fb73e54d5d5f3f2b0	437517273
